{"reviews":[{"id":"B0791G8SKW-0","r":5.0,"t":"AMAZING!!!!","x":"Super good quality! I didn\u2019t expect them to be so great because the price was so affordable but I will definitely be ordering this packing over and over again. My nails are SO shiny and have not chipped at all. Loved this!! TOP COAT is NO-WIPE! It cured so well and I did not need to wipe them with alcohol when I was done. I cured them for 60 seconds instead of 30 and that was enough for me to not have to wipe them after. So the top coat is great! Not tacky at all and very very shiny for me perso","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-1","r":5.0,"t":"great quality","x":"I usually buy a different brand and was a little hesitant to try something new. This product performed just fine if not better than my usual brand, and it was a much better price. Will definitely re-order this again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great gel polish kit!","x":"Great product for the money! Great start gel kit, worked wonderfully and the final product is professional. My nails are strong and very shiny","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great buy","x":"They make my polish last for at least two weeks every time! I HIGHLY recommend these polishes.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-4","r":5.0,"t":"great product","x":"Great for diy gel at home. In love with the no wipe top coat.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-5","r":5.0,"t":"Just what I was looking for!","x":"They dry super quickly under led lamp... and my gel polish lasts for weeks like salon quality. I would not call it 'no wipe' however.  It is still tacky when it's dried. You do need to go over these with alcohol which I'm fine with (as it dries quickly and lasts).","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-6","r":5.0,"t":"Highly recommended","x":"I\u2019ve been experimenting with gel products for a while. I'm done looking. This set is fantastic!! It holds up to my abuse. Easy to use, long lasting results, great price & quick shipping.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-7","r":5.0,"t":"Works Great!","x":"This works great!!!  Very controllable consistancy, not goopy and it cures very quickly.  Will definitely buy again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-8","r":4.0,"t":"Had an issue, solved","x":"My wife is a manicure specialist and tried a batch of different nail gels. This one is terrible quality. Even with using lamp longer it doesn't last more than 2-3 days. I wish I can return it.  Update 08/09/2019 Seller was able to refund me full amount and I found that an issue was potentially in my UV lamp. I will update review once will try to use it with another lamp.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-9","r":1.0,"t":"Cannot open the bottles, even with grips used on cars!!","x":"The bottles will not open! I even tried using tools to try and open 2 of the bottles. The lids are now all cracked and dented, but still will not open. The only one that opened, was the top coat. Of course, the dehydrator and base coat, the ones I really needed, will not open no matter what i try. A little upsetting when you pay for a product and cannot use it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-10","r":4.0,"t":"Very good","x":"I got it for try to do my nails at home and it\u2019s pretty good!! I would say that they just need number them to be more easy the order to use it !! Every time I need figure out which one I have to use first, second and third!! I\u2019m not a professional so if they number the order will be extremely helpful!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-11","r":5.0,"t":"The best yet","x":"I used to only use gelish base coat but the price went up so I\u2019ve been trying to find a replacement. This brand was amazing!! It\u2019s been 2+ weeks and my toes and fingers haven\u2019t chipped at all after using the prep, Base coat and too coat from this brand","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-12","r":4.0,"t":"best I can find","x":"If you prep your nails correctly, you will get about a week of really nice wear out of this product. I spent double the amount on a brand that wouldn't last a day, so I like this product. It definitely does not last more than a solid week though.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-13","r":5.0,"t":"Lo recomiendo 100%","x":"Es la primera ves que ago las u\u00f1as de gel y la verdad si funciona y mucho yo le ise las u\u00f1as a una amiga y ella trabaja muy duro de limpieza y a ella le tardo 2 semanas lo recomiendo 100%","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-14","r":1.0,"t":"I don't like it!","x":"Too thick! Some parts of nail polish just wont come off and others just peel with use.. Don't waste your money.. not worth it. Trust me!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-15","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste your money \ud83d\udcb0","x":"Don't waste your money!!! This happened to me after 2 days. I've never seen a gel polish with that quality before. Terrible!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-16","r":1.0,"t":"MISSING FOUNDATION GEL, NOT RETURNABLE","x":"Missing THE FOUNDATION GEL! The item is NOT RETURNABLE, I expect a replacement sent FREE OF CHARGE due to packaging issues","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-17","r":2.0,"t":"ph dehydrator smells like fish","x":"ph dehydrator smells BAD, and lifts really fast","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-18","r":4.0,"t":"Only one Issue","x":"Base and Top coat are great and cures very quickly with UV just as stated on the bottles.  My only issue might be with the dehydrator because my hard gel doesn't seem to bond quite well with my nail even after buffing and using this dehydrator.  I only took one star off because I am not 100% sure the issue is with the dehydrator, but I would order this again for the base and top coat items; it's worth the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-19","r":3.0,"t":"Not as expected","x":"Great value for the price, but with almost half a bottle left, the top coat has started to bubble and I had to replace it with a different brand. I did love this product right when I got it, but it has not lasted from only being able to use half the product and then have to toss it.  Too many bubbles in the top coat after only using half the bottle","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-20","r":5.0,"t":"Works great!","x":"It works! I\u2019m on day 3 of my manicure with this and still no signs of wear. It cures in the time it says it will, unlike the last gels I tried using. The price is excellent, too. I\u2019ve already started telling people about this brand.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-21","r":5.0,"t":"Long lasting","x":"I have tried 3 different base and top coats. This set has been my favorite. It hardens your nails and last over a week. That is a long time for me, because I am a vet tech and I\u2019m rough on my nails and constantly washing my hands.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-22","r":5.0,"t":"Totally worth it!","x":"Love......works great, cures well and is so shiny and smooth! This is the first time I have ever had gel nails and I did it myself. I'm sold....great product. Will buy again!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great price, long lasting!","x":"Really great all across the board. I don't think I've had gel nail polish hold up this long ever. No chips, no peeling. Will definitely buy this again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0791G8SKW-24","r":5.0,"t":"Will be buying more","x":"Love this set the price is also great the top coat is the bomb gives my nails life! Lol the Brest part after finishing your nails with this final touch","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the great value and quality for the price.","cites":[1,2,3,7,12]},{"text":"Many say the polish is long-lasting, often citing weeks of wear or salon-quality results.","cites":[4,6,7,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers love the no-wipe top coat and quick curing under the lamp.","cites":[1,5,6,8]},{"text":"A few reviewers report problems with the product, including bottles that won't open and polish that is too thick or doesn't last.","cites":[9,10,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers note minor usability issues, such as the top coat still being tacky or bottles not being numbered for order of use.","cites":[6,11]}]},"qa":[]}